        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Alarm Lock SirenLock 700 Touch Bar Panic Alarm Device\r\n</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThe Alarm Lock Sirenlock model 700 is a UL Listed panic alarm device.  It restricts unauthorized use of emergency exit doors by sounding blaring a 95db dual tone alarm when pushed, while still providing instant egress in emergencies.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe deadbolt and deadlatch meet relatching requirements.  Meets or exceeds UL, DFM, ADA, NYC housing requirements.  Non-handed surface installations on single or double doors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe exit device touch bar is labeled \"ALARMED EMERGENCY EXIT\". \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> for Alarm Lock Sirenlock 700\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Blaring 95db dual tone siren</li>\r\n<li>Selectable  2 minute alarm cutoff or manual reset</li>\r\n<li>9V battery powered </li>\r\n<li>Audible low battery warning</li>\r\n<li>33\" for use on doors up to 36\" wide</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li>ADA compliant</li>\r\n<li>Optional Brushed Aluminum or Dark Bronze finish</li>\r\n<li>Includes Schlage \"C\" keyway rim lock cylinder</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/Sirenlock-specs.pdf?v=1691094955\" target=\"new\"><b>Alarm Lock Sirenlock 700 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
